    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>ACTA (Amicale du Chien de Travail d'Antibes) is a dog club based in the 3 Moulins industrial area of Antibes, offering dog training, obedience, agility and ring sport.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The club is listed in the official directory of associations of the town of Antibes Juan-les-Pins, with two further independent confirmations (sports-canins.net and the association register net1901.org). This is a solid source for the address and phone number.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: contact the club before coming to check session times, which often vary by season.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Cap d'Antibes and its coastal trails are just a few minutes away by car to extend the outing.</p>
